{"availability":"available","full":"Squidly1408/squids-giftlist","name":"squids-giftlist","description":"Gift-list web app, create lists for any occasion, share a link, and let people claim gifts without spoiling the surprise. React + TypeScript + Firebase.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-17T00:19:02Z","updated":"2026-08-31T02:31:20Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://squids-giftlist.web.app/","topics":["firebase","firestore","gift-list","react","tailwindcss","typescript","vite","webapp","wishlist"],"demo":"https://squids-giftlist.web.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:27.807Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:27.807Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:27.807Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:24:27.807Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A gift-list web app: create an account, build gift lists for any occasion (Christmas, birthdays, weddings, and more), organize them into custom sections, and share a link so friends and family can claim gifts without spoiling the surprise — the list owner can never see who claimed what, only the overall progress. Other guests can see claims, so nobody buys the same thing twice.","Built with React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS on the frontend, and Firebase (Auth, Firestore, Hosting) on the backend — deliberately kept to Firebase's free Spark plan: no Cloud Functions, no Cloud Storage, no billing required at all."],"features":["Accounts — email/password and Google sign-in.","Multiple lists per user, each with an occasion (Christmas, birthday, wedding, baby shower,","graduation, anniversary, holiday, housewarming, or a custom occasion), an optional event date with a countdown, and a description.","Custom sections within a list (e.g. \"Clothes\", \"Big ticket\", \"Stocking stuffers\"), fully","editable and reorderable."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Squidly1408/squids-giftlist/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"bb553f29a05720a48adb9b2da8e2734aac7f697749ca513669c37dde57473add","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:27.911Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:27.911Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A gift-list web app: create an account, build gift lists for any occasion (Christmas, birthdays, weddings, and more), organize them into custom sections, and share a link so friends and family can claim gifts without spoiling the surprise — the list owner can never see who claimed what, only the overall progress. Other guests can see claims, so nobody buys the same thing twice.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Squidly1408/squids-giftlist/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"A gift-list web app: create an account, build gift lists for any occasion (Christmas, birthdays, weddings, and more), organize them into custom sections, and share a link so friends and family can claim gifts without spoiling the surprise — the list owner can never see who claimed what, only the overall progress.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Squidly1408/squids-giftlist/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Accounts — email/password and Google sign-in.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Squidly1408/squids-giftlist/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"bb553f29a05720a48adb9b2da8e2734aac7f697749ca513669c37dde57473add","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Squidly1408/squids-giftlist/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:27.911Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-31T02:31:20Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Squidly1408/squids-giftlist/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:27.912Z","hash":"bb553f29a05720a48adb9b2da8e2734aac7f697749ca513669c37dde57473add","originalBytes":6602,"storedBytes":6602,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["firebase","web","firestore","project","only","see","list","bash","clai